  "summary": "Demo2APK is a self-hostable web service that packages uploaded HTML/JS/React/ZIP projects into installable Android APKs via a Cordova/Capacitor/Gradle pipeline, with a REST API, Redis/BullMQ build queue, and configurable rate limiting and file retention. Evidence is documentation-only (README, API docs, deployment and ARM64 notes); no source code or eval harness appears in the snapshot. Evidence coverage: 209 of 306 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
